- No one stands before Ward Kripke.

252
00:15:06.697 --> 00:15:09.492
Okay. wast time.
it's "Word." not "Ward."

253
00:15:09.575 --> 00:15:10.785
Go ahead. stand. doesn't matter.

254
00:15:10.868 --> 00:15:15.623
With all due respect. my liege.
how is it that you're the... the grand...

255
00:15:15.706 --> 00:15:18.626
- Cawiph.
- Caliph of South Pasadena?

256
00:15:18.709 --> 00:15:21.087
I suppose we have time
for a wittle backstory.

257
00:15:21.170 --> 00:15:24.006
I apologize.
You guys have heard this before.

258
00:15:24.090 --> 00:15:29.554
When everything went screwy
and civilization as we know it cowapsed.

259
00:15:29.637 --> 00:15:32.932
a vacuum of weadership
was created here at the university.

260
00:15:33.015 --> 00:15:36.018
and as we all know...

261
00:15:36.769 --> 00:15:38.187
Nature abhors a vacuum?

262
00:15:38.271 --> 00:15:44.193
Wight-o. So. I seized power.
got all the food. the guns. and the girls.

263
00:15:45.236 --> 00:15:46.946
Yeah. end of backstory.

264
00:15:47.029 --> 00:15:49.490
But this world is a living nightmare.
Don't you wanna put things right?

265
00:15:49.574 --> 00:15:53.077
Were you not wistening?
I... I got all the girls.

266
00:15:53.161 --> 00:15:54.662
By the way...

267
00:15:55.329 --> 00:15:57.206
are you... you seeing anyone or...

268
00:15:57.290 --> 00:15:58.875
