- No. I'm not.

269
00:15:58.958 --> 00:16:01.252
I'm trying to protect you.

270
00:16:02.962 --> 00:16:04.964
Take the wench. wash her.
bring her to my woom.

271
00:16:05.047 --> 00:16:07.341
- I'd rather die!
- I understand.

272
00:16:08.176 --> 00:16:09.218
Wash her and kill her.

273
00:16:09.302 --> 00:16:10.678
- What? No!
- No. no. no.

274
00:16:10.761 --> 00:16:12.263
- Hey. hey. hey!
- What are you doing? Let go!

275
00:16:12.346 --> 00:16:13.973
- Hands off!
- Let me go! Get off of me!

276
00:16:14.056 --> 00:16:15.808
Hands off! Hey. hey! Hey!

277
00:16:17.435 --> 00:16:19.854
Stuart. please come back.

278
00:16:19.937 --> 00:16:22.148
Move towards the light!

279
00:16:23.733 --> 00:16:28.070
- No.
- Come on. wake up. I've got an idea.

280
00:16:29.739 --> 00:16:32.575
- What... Denise. Where's Denise?
- They took her.

281
00:16:32.658 --> 00:16:35.328
No. no! No. no. no. no!
I have to do something!

282
00:16:35.411 --> 00:16:36.579
Or...

283
00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:39.832
- Or what?
- You move on. you meet someone new.

284
00:16:39.915 --> 00:16:41.834
and they get eaten by a moth
on your honeymoon.

285
00:16:41.918 --> 00:16:44.712
- Excuse me. I have an idea.
- Go ahead.

286
00:16:44.795 --> 00:16:49.926
Like I said. this used to be
my Geology classroom.

287
00:16:50.009 --> 00:16:52.803
It's filled with all kinds
of rock samples.

288
00:16:52.887 --> 00:16:56.516
So. we're gonna throw rocks
at men with guns?

289
00:16:56.599 --> 00:16:58.893
'Cause if you don't know.
rock beats scissors. not gun.

290
00:16:58.976 --> 00:17:02.271
We're not gonna throw rocks.
We're gonna make bombs out of them.

291
00:17:02.355 --> 00:17:04.440
- What?
- Behold.

292
00:17:05.733 --> 00:17:07.944
Potassium. And some water.

293
00:17:08.027 --> 00:17:10.570
Everybody needs
to step back a little. please.

294
00:17:18.913 --> 00:17:22.375
- Cool. huh?
- Yeah. if the guards are taking a bath.

295
00:17:22.458 --> 00:17:25.920
No. We're gonna make grenades.

296
00:17:27.838 --> 00:17:31.092
- How come I never thought of that?
- Don't be hard on yourself.

297
00:17:31.175 --> 00:17:35.680
Most people underestimate
the mighty force that is geology.

298
00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:44.605
Sorry. fellas. Time to die.

299
00:17:45.398 --> 00:17:47.233
Agreed. Catch.

300
00:17:47.775 --> 00:17:49.026
What the...

301
00:17:52.655 --> 00:17:55.449
- I love you!
- I love you too.

302
00:17:55.533 --> 00:17:57.285
Let's go!

303
00:18:42.079 --> 00:18:43.623
So. what were you in the before times?

304
00:18:43.706 --> 00:18:46.292
- No talking.
- Come on. I'm gonna die anyway.

305
00:18:47.668 --> 00:18:50.796
I had a podcast. Vitamins. gut health.

306
00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:53.007
- Nice.
- I had Gwyneth Paltrow on.

307
00:18:53.674 --> 00:18:55.635
Oh. my God. I think I heard that.

308
00:18:55.718 --> 00:18:57.553
No. how a good gut biome
prevents dementia.

309
00:18:57.637 --> 00:18:58.679
- Yes!
- Yeah.

310
00:18:58.804 --> 00:19:00.598
- Thank you! That's exactly...
- It was so good. Yeah.

311
00:19:04.060 --> 00:19:07.021
Well. my dear. have you changed your mind?

312
00:19:07.104 --> 00:19:09.565
Is the choice still sex with you or death?

313
00:19:09.649 --> 00:19:11.150
Wook. I'm not a monster.

314
00:19:11.233 --> 00:19:15.529
I'm just proposing we have a nice dinner.
watch a movie. see what unfolds.

315
00:19:16.155 --> 00:19:18.616
- Kill me.
- Give us a minute.

316
00:19:24.497 --> 00:19:30.044
Wook. Being the ruler
of a post-apocalyptic fiefdom can be...

317
00:19:31.212 --> 00:19:32.630
very wonely.

318
00:19:32.713 --> 00:19:35.716
- What about your harem?
- Those girls don't really care about me.

319
00:19:35.800 --> 00:19:39.595
They're just here for the food.
medicine. free childcare.

320
00:19:43.933 --> 00:19:44.975
You know what?

321
00:19:45.518 --> 00:19:48.020
Fine. I will have dinner with you.

322
00:19:48.813 --> 00:19:51.732
- Wonderful.
- You'll have to untie me first.

323
00:19:52.692 --> 00:19:56.821
A real relationship is built on trust.
That has to start now.

324
00:19:59.865 --> 00:20:03.327
Okay. Hey. you wike venison?

325
00:20:03.411 --> 00:20:08.290
I make it with a cherwy gwaze.
The key is low-heat weduction.

326
00:20:13.003 --> 00:20:18.426
You are a stupid. stupid.
stupid. stupid. stupid man!

327
00:20:31.021 --> 00:20:32.189
Stay healthy.

328
00:20:33.733 --> 00:20:34.900
You too!

329
00:20:38.362 --> 00:20:39.363
Stuart!

330
00:20:39.447 --> 00:20:42.158
- I'm so glad you're okay.
- I'm so glad you're okay.

331
00:20:44.785 --> 00:20:47.413
Sorry. I'm covered with people.

332
00:20:48.038 --> 00:20:51.041
Yeah. everybody's okay. Let's go!

333
00:20:57.548 --> 00:21:01.218
- Thank God for geology!
- I do every day.

334
00:21:02.678 --> 00:21:04.096
There it is.

335
00:21:04.513 --> 00:21:06.015
Really? It looks like one
of those bread machines

336
