337
00:21:07.308 --> 00:21:10.352
It's a vari-state
quantum interference device!

338
00:21:10.436 --> 00:21:11.520
Could be both.

339
00:21:11.604 --> 00:21:13.939
- Can you fix it?
- Yes. I think so.

340
00:21:14.023 --> 00:21:15.858
Calibration is off.

341
00:21:15.941 --> 00:21:20.738
- Gotta reconfigure. Change the inputs.
- What's supposed to happen?

342
00:21:20.821 --> 00:21:23.073
Does everything just go back
to the way it was?

343
00:21:23.157 --> 00:21:24.992
Yeah. fingers crossed.

344
00:21:25.075 --> 00:21:27.119
