you and I would be together again.

345
00:21:27.203 --> 00:21:29.330
Slow down. champ. I'm still grieving.

346
00:21:30.664 --> 00:21:31.707
I think I got it!

347
00:21:34.835 --> 00:21:36.462
He don't got it.

348
00:21:36.545 --> 00:21:41.133
Barry. what did you do?
We're trying to fix the universe!

349
00:21:41.217 --> 00:21:43.677
I don't want it fixed!
I wike it the way it is.

350
00:21:43.761 --> 00:21:45.054
We don't.

351
