- Yeah. right here.

361
00:22:25.302 --> 00:22:26.804
Okay...

362
00:22:26.887 --> 00:22:30.057
- Disengage the attenuator.
- Okay.

363
00:22:33.978 --> 00:22:35.813
- Okay.
- Turn the main release.

364
00:22:44.071 --> 00:22:45.990
- Done!
- But first...

365
00:22:46.073 --> 00:22:48.200
"But first"?
What do you mean. "But first"?

366
