It worked.

372
00:23:35.164 --> 00:23:36.498
Look how beautiful.

373
00:23:37.708 --> 00:23:40.252
Wats. my weign has ended.

374
00:23:41.962 --> 00:23:45.382
- Hey. your bruises are gone.
- Oh. yeah.

375
00:23:46.133 --> 00:23:49.178
You wook good. I mean... for you.

376
00:23:50.387 --> 00:23:52.640
- Where's Denise?
- I don't know.

377
00:23:54.183 --> 00:23:55.726
I can't lose her again.

378
